Package: vabaxos-describe
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, llama.cpp-tools
Recommends: vabaxos-ocr, vabaxos-settings
Description: Descriptions of pictures without Internet
 Super+Alt+P describes the window in use, Super+Alt+Shift+P the whole
 screen, and "Open With" a picture file: a vision model runs on the
 computer with llama.cpp and the description, with the text written in the
 picture, opens in a plain window the screen reader reads (ADR-0029). The
 model (Qwen3.5 0.8B, about 1 GB) is downloaded once, when the user asks,
 and checked; it is not in the ISO.
